   "npc": "1374",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Curse that Brewers' League!  They have access to all the best ingredients, while we're stuck here grubbing for grain and hops!\n\nI really would like to give them some bitter tasting justice...",
